    <string name="settings_photos_prefetch_rate_help">Lower values react to scroll changes faster but cancel and re-submit work the workers had already started, causing spinners during fast scroll. Higher values let workers finish what they began, at the cost of the prefetch window updating less often. Default is 100 ms (10 updates/sec). Range 10–1000 ms.</string>
